    "RecordTitle": "[Translated] PROCESS TO IMPROVE THE PERMEATION IN THE SKIN OF A PHARMACOLOGICALLY ACTIVE COMPOUND, APPLIED TOPICALLY, WHICH OTHERWISE HAS A LOW SPEED OF PENETRATION IN THE SKIN; DEVICES WITH COMPARTMENTS AND ASSEMBLY USEFUL IN SUCH PROCESS.",
    "Section": [
